---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Chen Cohen.">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <h1 style="margin-top:3rem;">About</h1>
    <p>
      I'm <strong>Chen Cohen</strong> — a DevOps, SRE, and Platform Engineering
      professional with over a decade of experience architecting and operating
      large-scale cloud infrastructure.
    </p>
    <p>
      My career spans diverse industries — from cybersecurity and fintech to
      cloud networking and SaaS — working with companies like Qwilt, HoneyBook,
      Qualcomm, SentinelOne, Checkmarx, Elementor, Akamai, and SAP.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm passionate about building reliable, scalable platforms, automating
      everything that can be automated, and bridging the gap between development
      and operations with modern DevOps practices.
    </p>

    <h2>Work with me</h2>
    <div style="margin:2rem 0;padding:1.5em;background:var(--c-theme-light);border:2px solid var(--c-accent);border-radius:var(--radius,4px);text-align:center;">
      <h3 style="margin:0 0 0.5em;">Open for Consulting</h3>
      <p style="margin:0 0 1em;">
        Available for consulting engagements, cloud architecture reviews,
        platform engineering, and infrastructure automation projects.
      </p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:0.8em;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <a href="mailto:chenc@cohencil.com" style="display:inline-block;padding:0.6em 1.4em;background:var(--c-accent);color:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius,4px);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Get in touch</a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/chen-cohen-031a3b3/" style="display:inline-block;padding:0.6em 1.4em;border:2px solid var(--c-accent);color:var(--c-accent);border-radius:var(--radius,4px);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">LinkedIn</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>Personal</h2>
    <p>
      When I'm not building infrastructure, I enjoy exploring new technologies,
      contributing to open-source, and sharing knowledge with the community.
    </p>

    <h2>This site</h2>
    <p>
      This is my personal blog and portfolio — a collection of thoughts,
      tutorials, and deep dives into DevOps, cloud infrastructure, and platform
      engineering. All opinions are my own.
    </p>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
